[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="Conversation" format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://game/dialogue/conversation.gd" id="1_convo"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_convo")
id = &"n0_traveller_road"
text = "# DRAFT
# The traveller beside the porter on the carter's wagon, night 0, when the porter turns to talk to him on the road in.
# Before the cart with the body: small talk. After it (talked_n0_traveller): he has said his piece about the abbey, and points him to the Keys.
# The body cart cuts this talk short when it comes (Talk.interrupt), with no parting line.
== start
-> after [if talked_n0_traveller]
-> hello

== hello
Traveller: Evening, brother. Cold for Martinmas Eve.
Traveller: You've the look of a man who's been on the road since Lauds.
-> topics

== again
-> after [if talked_n0_traveller]
-> still

== still
Traveller: Still with me, brother? Talk won't make the carter go any faster.
-> topics

== topics
* [if not n0_road_from] Where have you come from? -> from
* [if not n0_road_trade] What takes you into London? -> trade
* [if not n0_road_carter] Is the carter always in such a hurry? -> carter

== from [set n0_road_from]
Traveller: Colchester, by way of every ditch in Essex.
Traveller: And you're from some little house in the country, by your boots. Sent up to the city to be useful.
-> topics

== trade [set n0_road_trade]
Traveller: Wool. I buy it cheap in Colchester and sell it dear in Cheapside, and every toll on the road robs me between.
Traveller: I'll sleep at Aldgate tonight, and be gone by Saint Edmund's.
-> topics

== carter [set n0_road_carter]
Traveller: They shut the city gates at the curfew bell. Be on the wrong side and you sleep in the ditch.
Traveller: He doesn't care to sleep in a ditch. Not this month.
-> topics

== after
Traveller: I've said my piece, brother. Keep your hood up.
-> after_topics

== after_topics
* [if not n0_road_think] What do you think goes on in that abbey? -> think
* [if not n0_road_ask] Who would know more? -> ask

== think [set n0_road_think]
Traveller: I think a man goes in at that gate with a full purse, and nobody sees him come out.
Traveller: Call that what you like. I'd call it a reason to keep walking.
-> after_topics

== ask [set n0_road_ask]
Traveller: The inn across the lane from your gate. The Cross Keys.
Traveller: Buy the landlord an ale and he'll talk till the candle's out.
-> after_topics

== leave
Traveller: Suit yourself, brother.
"
